<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', padding: 0 }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 14, height: 720, background: '#0E3F8C' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'relative', paddingTop: 62, paddingLeft: 96, paddingRight: 96, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

        {/* 页眉 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, marginBottom: 32 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 3 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', letterSpacing: 2 }}>五大功能模块：一个平台，五件事</Text>
        </Box>

        {/* 上排两卡 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26, marginBottom: 24 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 531, background: '#F5F8FD', borderRadius: 12, paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 24, paddingLeft: 28, paddingRight: 28, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>01</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>山货五件套生成器</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                    一次上传，并行生成营销文案、宣传海报、语音播报、短视频脚本、定价建议，打包交付。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 531, background: '#F5F8FD', borderRadius: 12, paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 24, paddingLeft: 28, paddingRight: 28, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>02</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>AI 数字讲解员</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                    为每个村落生成专属文化讲解，扫码即听，让"看风景"升级为"听故事"。
                </Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        {/* 下排三卡 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 340, background: '#F5F8FD', borderRadius: 12, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 22, paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 7, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>03</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>多厂商模型引擎</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    一套接口适配五家模型，环境变量即可切换，永不锁定单一厂商。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 340, background: '#F5F8FD', borderRadius: 12, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 22, paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 7, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>04</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>用户系统与历史</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    账号登录、生成记录留存、成果随时回看与二次下载。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 340, background: '#FDF8F7', borderRadius: 12, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 22, paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#D9534F', borderRadius: 7, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>05</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B3413D' }}>演示兜底机制</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B5A59', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    模型不可用时自动降级到内置样例，保证演示与使用永不中断。
                </Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>
</Slide>
